<view class="container game-page mathler-page">
  <view class="topline">
    <text class="game-kicker">思维闯关 · 02</text>
    <text class="title-badge">每日算式</text>
  </view>
  <view class="title-row">
    <text class="game-title">算式侦探</text>
    <text class="title-badge">6 次</text>
  </view>
  <view class="game-lead">隐藏一个两位数的 + / − 等式，每次猜完颜色会告诉你：绿=位置对，黄=符号对但位置不对，灰=没有。</view>

  <view class="mode-row">
    <view class="mini-tab {{mode === 'daily' ? 'active' : ''}}" bindtap="startDaily">每日</view>
    <view class="mini-tab {{mode === 'practice' ? 'active' : ''}}" bindtap="startPractice">练习</view>
    <view class="rules-toggle" bindtap="toggleRules">{{showRules ? '收起规则' : '规则'}}</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{showRules}}" class="hint-box">只用 + 和 −；两个操作数和结果都是两位数，等号固定在第 6 格。猜的等式本身必须成立。</view>

  <view class="status-line">
    <text class="status-strong">{{status}}</text>
    <text class="mono">{{mode === 'daily' ? dateStr : '练习'}} · 已猜 {{tries}}/6</text>
  </view>

  <view class="input-board">
    <view class="slot {{item.empty ? 'empty' : ''}} {{item.op ? 'op' : ''}} {{index === 5 ? 'eq' : ''}}" wx:for="{{display}}" wx:key="index">{{item.char}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="keys">
    <view class="key {{item === '提交' ? 'submit wide' : ''}} {{item === '+' || item === '−' ? 'wide' : ''}}" wx:for="{{keys}}" wx:key="*this" data-key="{{item}}" bindtap="press" hover-class="press">{{item}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="history">
    <view class="guess-row" wx:for="{{history}}" wx:key="index">
      <view class="guess-tile {{cell.mark}}" wx:for="{{item.cells}}" wx:for-item="cell" wx:key="index">{{cell.char}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{won}}" class="win-banner">
    <text class="win-icon">🎉</text>
    <view class="win-copy">
      <text class="win-title">🎉 猜中了！</text>
      <text class="win-sub">隐藏算式：{{answer}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{lost}}" class="answer-line">答案是 {{answer}}，换一题再来。</view>

  <view class="actions-row">
    <view class="btn-primary" bindtap="newRound">换一题</view>
    <view class="btn-ghost" bindtap="startPractice">练习模式</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{showRules}}" class="rule-box">
    <view class="rule-title">能学到什么 · 等式结构与反馈搜索</view>
    <view class="rule-text">一次猜测会同时排除很多可能：绿色锁定位置，黄色缩小符号范围。6 次不是靠运气，是把“哪些等式还成立”一步步缩小。</view>
  </view>
</view>
